# No-drift push gate (HARD)

Read `planning/NO-DRIFT-PROCESS-LOCKED.md` when unsure.

## Forbidden until checklist passes
Do **not** tell Andrew something is fixed, matched, locked-in visually, or done until:

1. Ruler named (Shop All / LOCKED OS / lock JSON)
2. `python3 scripts/lock-scan.py` clean on that template
3. **Pull-verify** after push (remote file actually has the change)
4. **Measured** vs ruler (computed px or side-by-side screenshot)
5. Correct Theme Editor `previewPath` for the page changed

## Code > Theme Editor
Shopify strips many checkbox/JSON settings on draft. For sitewide visual locks use CSS tokens + Liquid (`section.index`, template suffix, `!important` if needed). TE settings are mirrors, not the source of truth.

## Copy, don’t invent
If Shop All (or another ruler) already has the value, copy it. Never invent a sibling pad/type/gap.

## One axis, one proof, one done
No stack of “pushed” messages while the visual is still wrong.
